mereka pasti khawatirkanmu.

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:48.480
Baik!

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:51.190
Jangan sampai buat
orang lain khawatir!

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.230
Itulah laki-laki sejati!

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:54.770
Sampai jumpa!

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:57.740
Kalau perlu sesuatu,
