memerintahkanku, tak ada pilihan lagi.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:44.380
Kau mendengarku, tidak?

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:45.250
Namaku Yuno.

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:50.150
Aku punya nama,
namaku Yuno, Klaus.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:52.400
Aku seniormu.

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:56.340
Panggil aku Kak Klaus.

00:05:56.340 --> 00:05:57.400
Dimengerti.

00:05:58.650 --> 00:05:59.720
Jangan sampai terlambat.

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:31.900
Oh?

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:46.190
Yuno memang hebat!

00:06:46.890 --> 00:06:50.710
