00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:53.080
Kak Yuno hebat!

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.000
Hebat banget!

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:56.880
Akan kuberi tahu seluruh
penduduk desa!

00:06:57.380 --> 00:07:02.010
Oh ya, Sister,
apa isi surat Asta?

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:03.570
Tulisannya buruk banget, ya.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:05.400
Dia mau pulang kapan?

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.860
Kalau dia sudah sampai,
kita harus menghiburnya, ya.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:11.910
Aku yakin Asta pasti sangat sedih.

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:14.650
Kita harus adakan
pesta kentang super.

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:17.400
Katanya dia lulus.

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:24.070
Asta juga lulus.

